The provisioning address font is a subset of Montserrat Medium. The SSID
fallback preserves the non-ASCII glyphs and their kerning from LVGL's
Montserrat 14, including glyphs from Font Awesome 5. Both fonts use the
SIL Open Font License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL-Montserrat.txt and
assets/fonts/FontAwesome5-LICENSE.txt.

The battery and charging symbols are adapted from Lucide's battery-full and
battery-charging icons, Copyright (c) Lucide Contributors, ISC License.
See assets/ui/Lucide-ISC.txt.

ESP-IDF and Managed Components retain their own licenses in the installed
toolchain and managed_components directories. They are downloaded during setup
and build, and are not vendored into this source tree.

The original Big Fat Fish character reference was supplied from the companion
plugin's assets/whale-girl-front.png. Its expression atlas was generated with
built-in imagegen. See docs/whale-girl-assets.md for provenance and device-format
conversion.

The current Big Fat Fish expression atlas was generated with built-in imagegen
using the user-supplied ganfan.jpg, deyi.jpg and wuyu.jpg stickers and the
previous Big Fat Fish atlas. See assets/characters/generation.json for reference
hashes and generation prompts.

The ChatGPT dragon girl expression atlas was generated with built-in imagegen
from the user-supplied 148186519_p3_master1200.jpg character illustration.
See assets/characters/generation.json for the reference hash and prompt.

Downloadable custom-background examples in assets/backgrounds/examples/ were
generated with built-in imagegen and resized with Pillow on 2026-11-05. They
are provided under this repository's MIT license and are not embedded in firmware.
See docs/background-examples.md and assets/backgrounds/examples/generation.json
for the gallery, prompts, conversion details and output hashes.
